<title>CANADA: Imperial Oil raises posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Imperial Oil raises posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Oil Ltd said it raised the price it would pay for Edmonton light sweet crude oil by C$5.00/cubic metre or C$0.79/barrel, to C$178.00/cubic metre or C$28.30/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Other new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$170.00/cubic metre, or C$27.03/barrel</p>
<p>Bow River at Hardisty C$139.00/cubic metre, or C$22.10/barrel</p>
<p>Midale at Cromer C$150.00/cubic metre, or C$23.85/barrel</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
